{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Deal With The Devil guarantees Quickdraw critical hits (#2192)",
  "contract": [
    "Deal With The Devil (680255) explicitly guarantees Quickdraw critical strikes. Both Quickdraw ranks",
    "must have a 100% critical chance while the talent is active, and an ordinary player-submitted rank-1",
    "cast must land as a critical hit. Shadowblast, Sixfold Shot child hits, another hunter and the",
    "untalented state retain their normal chance. The readiness aura and crossbow are fixtures; cast",
    "costs and the native hit and critical resolution remain enabled. This regression does not assert",
    "client rendering or random proc rates."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
